past revision of this repository.)


ART ASSETS — AI 생성 고지

The image assets under casual/, ui/, vfx/, dice/, props/, towers/, enemies/,
map/, store/, resources/ and android/app/src/main/res/ were generated with
OpenAI image models (gpt-image-*) from prompts authored by this project,
then composited, rigged and reviewed by the authors.

  Prompts            ART-PROMPTS.md, GROK-BRIEF.md
  Generator          tools/img-gen.mjs
  Palette source     content.js  INF_PALETTE / INFINITY.paletteOf(w)
  Review record      tools/art-review/, ASSET-MANIFEST.md

No third-party artwork, photography or scanned material was used as input.

AUDIO

No third-party audio is bundled. Background music is synthesised at runtime
in code (music.js, WebAudio). The audio/ directory is absent by design; if
licensed music files are added later, their source and licence must be
recorded in ASSET-MANIFEST.md first.


